{
  "id": "RUT.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "RUT",
  "reference": "Ruth 4",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "RUT 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bowaz nywomo Ruth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bowaz okidho i waŋkac to bedo piny kenyo; to wat pere m'oyido go otieko luwo kwoŋe bende bino. Bowaz olwoŋo go ka waco ama: “Biye bedi kome jawodhan”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo to Bowaz kwanyo cwo apar kwoŋ jotel ma tindi to waco rijo bende bedo piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Bowaz waco ri wat pere no ni, “Naume otieko weyo piny Mowab odwoko ka; go pama tana adec ma lowo m'oyido obedo apa wat mawan Elimelek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An won aparo ni ber awaci rin gime, k'inyalo, nyew ruwaŋ ji me kanyacel gi jotel pa ji paran ma jobedo me. To k'ikimiti, wac ran i hongo me won, kwoŋbedo an bende anyalo tero paka cik ma lunjirok waco”. Jalo odwoko ni, “Abino nyewo”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bowaz owaco rigo ni, “Tekin inyewo lowo ma bongi Naume, ŋey nike bende ilunjo Ruth citho ma wok Mowab, ŋey lowo wodoŋ i nyingi peco pa jatho”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jalo odwoko ni, “Akinyali nyewo kwoŋbedo meno nyutho ni nyithindho paran jok'olunji. Nyew, to an be”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.25.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 25:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka i piny pa Joisiraili, ma ridho wil kosa mitan, ŋata tana onwaŋo kwanyo war pere to miyo ŋata nyewo. Me nyutho winjirok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jalo to waco ri Bowaz ni, “Nyew.” Aka ogonyo war pere to miyo Bowaz. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bowaz owaco ri jodongo kodi ji je ni, “Wibedo jokony ni konon anyewo lim me m'oyido obedo apa Elimelek kodi apa yac pere Kilion gi Mahilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.25.5+DEU.25.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 25:5-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Medo kwoŋ meno, Ruth nyar Jamowab ciliendi Mahilon lokere dhako paran. Gime bino miyo lim pa Mahilon wodoŋ i nyingi go; aka nyinge kilarere i dier ji gi piny pere. Wibedo jokony ma gime konon”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ji je m'oyido jonitie i waŋkac kanyacel gi jodongo jodwoko ni, “Wabedo jokony. Wakwayo ni Rwoth wokonyi dhako me m'ikidho nywomo wobedi paka Laker gi Leya, ma jonywolo nyithindho kweth ri Yakobo. Mondo ibedi ŋat'oŋaŋ i nono ma Efratha kodi ŋat'oŋeyere i Bethelehem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.38.27+GEN.38.28+GEN.38.29+GEN.38.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 38:27-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth wokonyin inwaŋ nyithindho gi dhako me, aka peco perin wobedi paka apa Perez ma Tama onywolo ri Yuda”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piyo piyo to Bowaz tero Ruth bedo cege, obedo gine, aka Rwoth okonyo go ogamo iye to nywolo wode. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo mon ma tindi ma Bethelehem jowaco ri Naume ni, “Rwoth wopak ma k'othwonin nyakwarin ndelo me, weyi go woŋeyere i piny Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go wokurin to bedo kwot perin ka iti. Kole ciwodin manitie rin gi cwe loyo yac abirio am'onywolo go”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naume otiŋo nyathi i kore to cako kikwonga go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mon mager jowaco ni, “Naume onywolo wode”. To jomiyo go nyinge ni Obed. Obed onywolo Yese, Yese onywolo Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a nyikway Perez. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Perez obedo ba Heziron, Heziron ba Ram, Ram ba Aminadab, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aminadab ba Nason, Nason ba Salimon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salimon ba Bowaz, Bowaz ba Obed, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obed ba Yese. To Yese nywolo Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
